{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263Qm7MMWPub1794972705.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有「流星雨之王」美譽的獅子座流星雨近日進入活躍期。據天文資料顯示，獅子座流星雨的活躍期為每年11月6日至30日。這場天文盛事以流星速度快、亮度高為主要特色，觀賞性極高。</p><p></p><p><strong>火流星劃破夜空　母體源自彗星</strong></p><p></p><p>在活躍期間，偶爾會出現極為耀眼的火流星，照亮夜空，令人驚嘆。這一切壯麗景觀的背後，源自其母體「坦普爾-塔特爾彗星」。獅子座流星雨正是地球穿過這顆彗星遺留在軌道上的塵埃帶時，塵粒衝入大氣層燃燒所形成的天文現象。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METROR 黑龍江同江市\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zLyrqN8ZDe1794970449.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江同江市</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江富錦市\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xYuQDXXiZn1794970511.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>LEO METEOR 黑龍江富錦市</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江大慶市杜爾伯特蒙古自治縣阿木塔旅遊度假區\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264x6Q8264tz1794970564.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江大慶市杜爾伯特蒙古自治縣阿木塔旅遊度假區</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江齊齊哈爾\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jN5InOeXkh1794970610.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江齊齊哈爾</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江富錦市\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hfKF1Ceugi1794970663.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江富錦市</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江佳木斯市郊區\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026phrzDQI6lg1794970709.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江佳木斯市郊區</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江牡丹江市\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269vKLvUJs3g1794970759.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江牡丹江市</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江同江市\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vgLbCl1JZ31794970807.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江同江市</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"LEO METEOR 黑龍江大慶市\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pTi5HAL7wI1794970852.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>黑龍江大慶市</p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:24.332590+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T22:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:41.260798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:37.221265+00:00","content_hash":"8ebc9334e09e28498bc6209e992ec3ef32323349b2e51194ad17141073d97129","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:24.332590+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}